description: Require ≥3 assertion patterns — visibility/text, value/nav, API/HTTP
alwaysApply: true
---

# Assertion Patterns

Use at least these three patterns across the suite:

## 1. Visibility / text

```ts
await expect(page.getByRole('heading', { name: 'Hồ sơ' })).toBeVisible();
await expect(page.locator('.error')).toContainText('Số điện thoại không hợp lệ');
await expect(page.getByTestId('status')).toHaveText('Đã hủy');
```

## 2. Value / attribute / navigation

```ts
await expect(page.getByLabel('Họ tên')).toHaveValue('Nguyen Van A');
await expect(page).toHaveURL(/\/profile/);
await expect(page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Lưu' })).toBeEnabled();
```

## 3. HTTP / API

```ts
const res = await page.request.put('/api/profile', { data: payload });
expect(res.ok()).toBeTruthy();
const body = await res.json();
expect(body.phone).toMatch(/^0/);
```

Failing assertions that reveal real SUT defects belong in `bug-report.md` with screenshots (see `evidence-screenshots` rule).
